  "answer": "The money is sent after the refund is initiated, which happens within 2 business days of pickup once the item passes quality check. For ZentroMart Plus members, the refund is initiated at pickup. The time it takes for the refund to reach the customer depends on the payment method, with UPI, ZentroMart Wallet, and bank transfer (NEFT) for cash-on-delivery orders taking 1 to 3 business days, 2 hours, or 5 to 7 business days respectively.",
